@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/api/employee

@employeeUser1 = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@employeeId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@projectCustomerPortal = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@projectErp = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@seedSubmittedEntry = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@seedRejectedEntry = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@pass = pass

# READ


### Get my time entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}

###

### Get my projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/MyProjects
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}

###

# Month is already locked for this employee

### Read the existing submitted entry that already locks April
GET {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries/{{seedSubmittedEntry}}
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}

###

### Try creating a new entry in April 2026 
### Should fail because month already has submitted/approved records
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-14",
  "hours": 1,
  "description": "Should fail because April is already locked in seed data",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectCustomerPortal}}"
}

###

### Try submitting April again (should fail because there are no draft entries to send)
POST {{baseUrl}}/submitMonth
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 4
}

###

# Rejected entry exists, but Employee still cannot create a correction in April
# because the month is already locked by other submitted entries in seed data

### Read the existing rejected entry from seed data
GET {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries/{{seedRejectedEntry}}
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}

###

### Try creating a corrective draft 
### Employee already has Submitted entries in April
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-15",
  "hours": 1,
  "description": "Corrected draft after rejection",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectErp}}"
}

###


# VALIDATIONS  ALL SHOULD FAIL


### Weekend date
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-05",
  "hours": 4,
  "description": "Should fail - weekend",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectCustomerPortal}}"
}

###

###  Future date 
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2029-04-24",
  "hours": 4,
  "description": "Should fail - future date",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectCustomerPortal}}"
}

###
### Previous month
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-15",
  "hours": 4,
  "description": "Should fail - not current month",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectCustomerPortal}}"
}

###

### Hours not in quarter-hour increments (1.33)
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-14",
  "hours": 1.33,
  "description": "Should fail - invalid increment",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectCustomerPortal}}"
}

###

### C5. More than 8 hours in a day (Héctor already has 8h on 2026-04-01)
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-01",
  "hours": 1,
  "description": "Should fail - exceeds daily limit",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectCustomerPortal}}"
}

###

### C6. Creating with status != Draft (e.g., Submitted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-14",
  "hours": 2,
  "description": "Should fail - status not allowed",
  "status": "S",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeId}}",
  "project_ID": "{{projectCustomerPortal}}"
}

###

# UPDATE VALIDATIONS

### Try updating a Submitted entry 
### Should fail becaise not Draft)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries/{{seedSubmittedEntry}}
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hours": 3
}

###

### D2. Try updating a Rejected entry (should fail - not Draft)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries/{{seedRejectedEntry}}
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser1}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hours": 3
}

###

# SCENARIO E: OTHER EMPLOYEES

# Has:
# 6h, Approved (A) on Customer Portal
# 60000000...004: 2026-04-04, 5h, Draft (D) on Sales Mobile App

@employeeUser2 = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser2}} {{pass}}

###

### Should fail has Approved entry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/MyTimeEntries
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser2}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-10",
  "hours": 2,
  "description": "Should fail - April locked by approved entry",
  "employee_ID": "{{employeeUser2}}",
  "project_ID": "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
}

###
### Expected: 200 - "Submitted 1 time entry for 2026-04"
POST {{baseUrl}}/submitMonth
Authorization: Basic {{employeeUser2}} {{pass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 4
}




